    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuɔ̱c Nɛɛni ti tekɛ juey rɛy wec",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Muthɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jio̱kni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱ ka̱mɛ nɛy tin tekɛ dhɔp raar rɛy wec kɛnɛ tin diaal tin tekɛ löny riɛm jua̱th mi jiääk kɛ tin ca rɔ̱ ya̱r kɛ thi̱epdiɛn kɛ mi ci li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutni kɛnɛ män bia kɛ ka̱m raar rɛy wec, kɛ ɣöö /ci wecdiɛn bi jiääk, guäth in cieŋä thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ la̱t ni nɔ, cukɛ kɛ naŋ raar rɛy wec, ce̱tnikɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r Muthɛ, cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ la̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cut la̱t kä mi jiääk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Muthɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jio̱k ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, “Mi wä wut kiɛ ciek duer wä la̱t kɛ thil ŋäthädɛ kɛ Kuoth Nhial a bɛ duer ɛn ram ɛ mɔ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a jɛ lat duerɛ ɛn ram ɛmɔ, kä a jɛ col duerɛ, a repɛ jɛ kɛ dhieec dhieecni, kä a jɛ kämɛ ram in cɛ due̱r duer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi thilɛ jɛ gua̱n maarä ɛn ram in ca due̱r due̱r mi ba culikä, bi cut ɛmɔ wä kä Kuoth Nhial kä bööth palä, kä ba dɔdɛ̈ɛ̈l luël mat thi̱n min ba luɛl ni gua̱n dui̱rä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä muc diaal, nyin ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ, tin ba nöŋ bo̱o̱th palä, bi ka nyinkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi tin gɔw a nyinkɛ, kä tin diaal tin bi raan kɛ thöp bo̱o̱th palä kɛ nyinkɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ wutdä mi diiw ciekdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Muthɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jio̱k ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, “Mi ci ciek wutdä wä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi ci wut dɔ̱diɛn tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ kual, kä cɛ tëë kä cɔwdɛ, a /ka̱n ɛ ŋa̱c, kä thilɛ ram mi /ci jɛ nɛn, kä /ka̱n jɛ ka̱p thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi cɔwdɛ jɛ diw kɛ mi cɛ la̱t, a cäŋ /kenɛ jɛ la̱t bä ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bi wut ciekdɛ nöŋ bo̱o̱th palä, kä bɛ muc nööŋ kɛ kui̱c ciekdɛ, wa̱l wa̱a̱li nuɔ̱p mi /ka̱n moc liɛth kä /ka̱n moc wal ti kɔp, kɛ ɣöö ɛ muc bɛɛl mi diɛw, kɛ kui̱ ti̱mä dui̱rä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä bi bo̱o̱th palä ciek nööŋ thiekä, kä bɛ jɛ nyuɔ̱r nhiam Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi bo̱o̱th palä pi̱ tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ̱ ka̱n rɛy dhar muɔ̱ɔ̱n, kä bɛ tup in te rɛy kɛmɛkä ka̱n kä bɛ jɛ la̱th rɛy pi̱i̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi bo̱o̱th palä ciek la̱th nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä bɛ bi̱i̱ wec ciek woc, kä bɛ muc bɛɛl ti̱mä la̱th tetkädɛ, min la muc di̱wä, kä bi bo̱o̱th palä pi̱ lam ti kɛ̈c kɛ̈ɛ̈c rɔm kɛ tetdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi bo̱o̱th pal ciek jak kä yacɛ rɔ wee i̱, ‘Mi thilɛ wut mi ci tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ ji̱, kä /keni wä gekä kä ti jiäk, min ti tetdä cɔadu bi kään pi̱i̱ni ti kɛ̈c kɛ̈ɛ̈c ti nööŋkɛ la̱m ti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi ci wä raar, a cäŋ ti tetdä cɔadu, a ci rɔ ya̱r, kä ci tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ wut mi dɔ̱diɛn mi /ci mɔ a cɔwdu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni ɣöö, ‘Bi Kuoth Nhial ji̱ kuɛth kä bɛ ji̱ jak kä cäät rɛy nɛɛniku, mi wä Kuoth Nhial cio̱o̱kdu wä jak kä pɛn kä puɔ̱ɔ̱tdɛ puɔ̱nydu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi pi̱ la̱m ti̱ti̱ wä jiidu ba jicdu wä puɔ̱t kä ba cio̱o̱kdu ka̱m raar.’ Kä bi ciek wee i̱, ‘Inɔnɔ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛn lamni ti̱ti̱ bi bo̱o̱th palä kɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk, kä bɛ kɛ lak rɛy pi̱i̱ni tin kɛ̈c kɛ̈ɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ ciek jak kä maathɛ pi̱ tin kɛ̈c kɛ̈ɛ̈c tin nööŋkɛ lam, bɛ kɛ math kä ba jicdɛ moc bɛ̈c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi bo̱o̱th muc di̱wä bɛɛl ka̱n tetdä ciek, bɛ muc bɛɛl ŋuëŋ Kuoth Nhial, kä bɛ jɛ nööŋ yi̱kä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi bo̱o̱th palä jic tetdä kɛl kä nup ka̱n kä muc bɛɛl, ala duŋ ti̱mä, kä bɛ jɛ waŋ wi̱i̱ yi̱kä, kɛ kɔrɛ bɛ ciek cu jak kä maathɛ pi̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wëë thuɔ̱k kɛ ma̱th pi̱i̱ni. Mi cɛ rɔ ya̱r, a cɛ cɔwdɛ la̱t a jiäk, bi pi̱ tin cɛ math tin nööŋkɛ lam jicdɛ jak kä bɛc, kä bɛ puɔ̱nydɛ pua̱a̱t, kä bi cio̱o̱kdɛ ben raar, bi ciek cu tekɛ buar rɛy nɛɛnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /kenɛ rɔ ya̱r ɛn ciek a thilɛ mi cɛ la̱t, thilɛ mi bi jɛ jek, kä bɛ gaatkɛ dap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
